This is a native bare-swift package; it is not derived from any upstream
Rust crate. The parser implements RFC 9110 § 5.6.2 / § 8.3 directly, and
the catalog is curated from the IANA Media Types registry
(https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml).
